    jit_block_use_same_name_class_segv_2026-11-27, P3, closed, "stale: FIXED by p3sweep6-20261128 (codegen/jit.rs unresolved_imports_called records _dot_-sanitized dotted callees -> NULL-jump guard catches block-used class constructors, fail-closed demotion; doc probes rc 139 -> rc 0 with owner-aware output); shard row re-closed 2026-11-28 after a merge clobbered the closure", doc/08_tracking/bug/jit_block_use_same_name_class_segv_2026-11-27.md, 1, doc/08_tracking/bug/jit_block_use_same_name_class_segv_2026-11-27.md, 2026-11-27, 2026-11-28, true
